{
  "_doc": "The Panzer IV Ausf. H. 5.92 m long hull by 2.88 m wide by 2.68 m tall. A boxy hull of flat plates with vertical sides and a stepped front: low nose, then the vertical driver's plate. A boxy turret narrowing upward, a stowage bin across the back, the cupola at the rear of the roof. The long 75 mm L/48 gun with a double-baffle muzzle brake overhangs the nose by a metre. Eight small road wheels a side in four leaf-spring bogies, four return rollers, a front sprocket, a rear idler, a flat top run. Dark yellow (skin), rubber and dark steel (pale, frame2), a paler yellow (mark). Top-run width is a little exaggerated (no side skirts or wide guards) to read at game size.",
